From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:18:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add DS buttons

sdl_input.c makes START the escape key and A, B, X, Y, L and R joystick
0, with the d-pad as its axes. Wolfenstein's joystick bindings put them
on fire, use, next weapon, run and strafing. The joystick is always
enabled, a config can't turn the buttons off. There is no mouse.

The d-pad turns a bit slower than it moves, and at half that
for the first 12 tics so a tap can aim, like DOOM. Turning at the move
speed made the player hard to control on the hardware.
